==Description==
The '''Rhegus Greaves''' is a gear item that is equipped in the legs slot. When activated (default {{Key|Y}}) the greaves allow the player to walk on walls, upside down, basically on any surface. They will stay activated until deactivated by pressing {{Key|Y}} or when they break after being used for a while. Currently, Atlas pulsing does '''not''' knock the player off of the ship making them a very useful boarding tool.
